[{"client_msg_id":"362acde2-3821-42c7-a499-17d2f3bdbb93","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"授業で大学は選んでないですしね・・・研究したい内容と教授で選んでるんで・・・","ts":"1617154731.042600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QCTfJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33365ac3-6eb4-4d0b-8755-e19adfbb9dc7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んー雑用は絶対量の問題なのではないのでは。頭脳職では割込みがかかることの弊害のほうが大きいってのは、我々にとってはだいたい経験済みでしょ。\n\nあとうまい授業が聞きたかったってのは後出し孔明で全く意味がない。っていうかそれこそ受ける側にそういう意思があれば、そういう大学に入るなり授業を受けに行くなり、方法がなかったわけではない。そういう発想がなかったことによる問題で、それを指摘することに意味はない。","ts":"1617154670.041800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1617154696.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"idn8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaefec78-c160-488d-8a43-f1941c3ada1c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"少なくとも私はもっとうまい授業が聞きたかったですね。白熱教室とかyoutuberの大学講義とかを聞いてるとやっぱりそう思ってしまう。\n研究はこの教授といっしょにやりたいみたいなのがあったから、その人が授業するの下手でもそこはOKでしたけど・・・","ts":"1617154452.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CXlc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a516970a-0ee9-4af6-962d-f0121eddbb27","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"雑用は欧米レベルまで減らした方がいいけど、それでもやっぱり絶対量が少ない気はしてますね。。。","ts":"1617154321.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xRFA/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8a40bdb-fe91-4500-b5f9-09e9240c53e4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"大学ともなれば教育がうまい必要はないと思うんです。教える気がまったくないのは論外ですけど、基本的には学ぶほうの能力。","ts":"1617154320.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jZv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B3558F4A-C7BF-4C4C-8948-214D36A28A69","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"講義のウマさは正直役職でなくて人によるんですよね。でも私が受けた時に感動した講義は教授によるものが多かったかなあ","ts":"1617154252.036000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1617154279.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NfOpp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48ae8306-43ed-4aaa-aa2a-0bbe4f2f63c3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それを解決しないといけない。","ts":"1617154244.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZRY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"192a414c-26a5-4aa7-b657-54a4220b0e73","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"問題は研究・教職員が雑用に時間を取られることのほうで","ts":"1617154239.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e=2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9a8de1d-bc40-440a-831e-0804d004026c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"うーんよい先生とよい研究者は違うって認識ですね。基礎部分はやっぱりよい先生からの授業を受けたい","ts":"1617154227.034500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Mgx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e11c3c6-1ecd-45a8-98df-d8e6ea887891","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"学生としては、良い先生の講義はテンプレでも得るものがある、という話。","ts":"1617154178.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FwjC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e94eb93-9c9b-4db1-82b9-e132fbe92a6e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや特別講義だと数が少ない。","ts":"1617154142.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Z2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cd0677e-398e-4929-9a85-e0125bc772ef","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"時間は有限ですからね・・・お互いに","ts":"1617153825.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EHA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eda20b6c-1e44-4ed0-b730-4f4e75c0927d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"基礎講義への殺意が高い！","ts":"1617153531.030000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":2,"users":["U01H161HVPS","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DCW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f88008c-7b6b-43f6-b76c-2c659e7bf4d2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"講義やらなくていいとは別に言ってなくって特別講義形式（基礎的なのは別の人に殺ってもらって、全体時間を短くした形式）でいいんじゃって言ってるんですが・・・","ts":"1617153260.029800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vS57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c84b80a-c395-47aa-938e-586b337f0036","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"昔は教授ともなれば秘書さんがいたものだけども…いまはいないんかねぇ。","ts":"1617152310.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OEQWw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9578e68-6bb9-4c66-9102-1b7d4768b91b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちゃんと研究してる先生の講義は雑談や質問にこそ華があるよ。","ts":"1617152174.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCmB"}]}]
